        "detailed_description": "Space Lattice is a single player <i>virtual reality puzzle game</i> where you stack blocks into a giant 3D lattice in space. Endless blocks will fall at you from above at increasing rates. Complete rows, columns, or levels to <u>clear the blocks in all three dimensions</u>. If you drop a block or do not catch a block fast enough then the block will appear in your pocket for later use. Be careful because once your pockets are full the game will end.<br><br>You will need to use your hands to twist the held block into position in the 3D lattice (3D grid).<br>Meet the blocks:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036630/extras/BlockSimple_450x174.gif?t=1766119918\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036630/extras/BlockComplex_450x174.gif?t=1766119918\" /></span><br><br>You will need to strategically position yourself around the 3D lattice for optimal block placement <strong>OR Grab</strong> the 3D lattice <strong>and rotate</strong> it instead. Just sit in your favorite chair for a chill experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036630/extras/Rotate_609x340.gif?t=1766119918\" /></span>",
